{"seq":6,"slug":"role-career-paths","title":"各角色成长与晋升路线","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/role-career-paths","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"engineering","title":"Costco 技术工程岗位发展路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/role-career-paths/engineering","wordCount":2899,"readingTime":12},{"seq":2,"slug":"warehouse-operations","title":"Costco 仓库运营岗位路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/role-career-paths/warehouse-operations","wordCount":1286,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"merchandising-buying","title":"Costco 采购与商品管理岗位路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/role-career-paths/merchandising-buying","wordCount":1353,"readingTime":6},{"seq":4,"slug":"marketing-membership","title":"Costco 市场与会员运营路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/role-career-paths/marketing-membership","wordCount":1416,"readingTime":6},{"seq":5,"slug":"finance-accounting","title":"Costco 财务会计路径","url":"/l-doc-books/h/corporate-management/costco/role-career-paths/finance-accounting","wordCount":1459,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"各角色成长与晋升路线\">各角色成长与晋升路线</h1><p>本章按照 Costco 的主要岗位类型，详细梳理各角色的成长路径、能力要求、晋升时间线和推荐学习资源。Costco 的岗位体系以仓储运营为核心，同时包含采购、技术、市场、财务等职能线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章内容\">本章内容</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>技术工程岗位</strong>：电商平台/供应链系统/数据分析/会员系统/仓储自动化方向的完整晋升路径</li>\n<li><strong>仓库运营岗位</strong>：从一线员工到仓库经理的实战路径</li>\n<li><strong>采购与商品管理</strong>：买手和品类经理的专业发展</li>\n<li><strong>市场与会员运营</strong>：会员增长、数字营销、零售媒体方向</li>\n<li><strong>财务会计</strong>：从分析师到 CFO 的路径与能力要求</li>\n</ul>\n"}